-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",394,{
[12577]="7002FDA1\n1\tDefeat Orcs at the southern croft (total: 10)\030Scavenge Orc-caches (total: 6)\tThe Orcs can be found at the southernmost croft of Garsfeld, south-west of the town. Gísil wants you to take back the southernmost croft of Garsfeld.\n2\tTalk to Gísil\tGísil can be found inside the Mead Hall of Garsfeld. You should return to Gísil with news of your success.\n",
[12578]="7000120C\n1\tFind the hidden holding of the dwarves\tThe dwarf-holding is east of Rammas Deluon and south of Duvuinen. The merchant Torcuil asked you to seek the lost dwarves and obtain their allegiance.\n2\tTalk to the leader of Gabilshathûr\tThere are many dwarves within Gabilshathûr. You have discovered hidden holding of the dwarves in Angmar, Gabilshathûr. You should speak with someone within the holding and convey Torcuil's message.\n",
[12579]="7000D943\n1\tFind the hidden holding of the dwarves\tThe dwarf-holding lies to the east of Rammas Deluon and south of Duvuinen. Búdan spoke to you of a hidden holding of the dwarves in Angmar and suggests that the dwarves could use your aid.\n2\tTalk to the leader of Gabilshathûr\tThe leader of the dwarves is at Gabilshathûr. You have discovered hidden holding of the dwarves in Angmar, Gabilshathûr. You should seek out and speak with the leader of the dwarves.\n",
[12580]="7001CEF2\n1\tSearch near Dannenglor for the Malledhrim scouts\tDannenglor is to the north of the Haunted Inn. Fernachar has asked you to search the ruins of Dannenglor for signs of the Elf-scouts who went that way. You should approach Dannenglor cautiously, following the road where the Elf explorers went.\n2\tTalk to Fernachar at the Haunted Inn\tFernachar awaits you in the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, south of Dannenglor. You should speak with Fernachar and tell him of the worrying scene you beheld when you approached Dannenglor.\n",
[12581]="7000EEC9\n1\tTalk to Cenlieg\tForochel lies north of Evendim, through Cirith Rhiw, north of Tyrn Fornech. You should start your search in the town of Kauppa-kohta. Helegdir asked you to seek out a member of a fellowship of adventurers who journeyed to Forochel, passing through Aughaire in Angmar.\n",
[12582]="70040ED5\n1\tTalk to Dolvir\tDolvir can be found on a hilltop to the east of Edhellond. Gilanor has asked you to seek Dolvir outside Edhellond in hopes you can weaken the Corsairs' hold on the coast.\n",
[12583]="70021E84\n1\tFind Umfrë in the Mournshaws\tUmfrë is lost somewhere in the Mournshaws. Daervunn asked you to find Umfrë the hunter, who disappeared into the forest, hunting for a Cun Annun that had been terrorizing his village.\n2\tTalk to Umfrë at Echad Daervunn\tUmfrë is at Echad Daervunn in the Mournshaws. You should return to Daervunn's camp and speak with Umfrë.\n",
[12584]="7003043E\n1\tFind the lost keepsake near the ruins of Hytbold\tThe keepsake can be found near the ruins of Hytbold to the north-west of Walstow.\n2\tTalk to Adalgifu\tAdalgifu can be found in central Walstow.\n",
[12585]="70002EFA\n1\tCollect the Dourhand mining map (quantity: see journal)\tForeman Nyrad can be found in the Dourhand camp north of Othrikar. Regin is at Othrikar. Regin believes that Nyrad, the previous foreman, stole the map, but left the records, since he could not read the runes. Regin has suggested that you may find the map either in Foreman Nyrad's tent or on Nyrad himself.\n2\tReturn the map to Regin\tYou have found the map stolen by Foreman Nyrad.\n",
[12586]="7002CA6A\n1\tFind Cabed's lost trinket\tCabed has sent you in search of a trinket he once carried. The trinket is located somewhere outside Ost Celebrant.\n2\tTalk to Cabed\tCabed is atop a small hill along the southern road of Parth Celebrant. You should bring the red-tipped arrowhead to Cabed.\n",
[12587]="7004CE28\n1\tFind the lost pages of the tome\tKing Thorin III thinks the lost pages of the tome may point the way to the Secret Stone. Perhaps one of the pages is inside Erebor.\n2\tFind the lost pages of the tome\tKing Thorin III thinks the lost pages of the tome may point the way to the Secret Stone. You should follow the clues of the rune scraps.\n3\tFind the lost pages of the tome\tKing Thorin III thinks the lost pages of the tome may point the way to the Secret Stone. You should follow the clues of the rune scraps.\n4\tFind the lost pages of the tome\tKing Thorin III thinks the lost pages of the tome may point the way to the Secret Stone. You should follow the clues of the rune scraps.\n5\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[12588]="700572FF\n1\tGive Ashmâr-abân to Náin the Slakeless\tThe pendant you found in the Howling Pit has been revealed to be a lost artifact of Durin's Folk. You should give Ashmâr-abân to Náin the Slakeless.\n2\tTalk to Náin the Slakeless\tAshmâr-abân has been transformed! You should talk to Náin the Slakeless.\n",
[12589]="70030402\n1\tTalk to Aldstan\tThe Rohirrim must surely be nearby. You should try to find this Man, and see if he has strength enough to return to Walstow.\n2\tTalk to Winsig\tWinsig will be most interested to learn of this man's assault against you. Winsig can be found in the mead-hall of Walstow.\n",
[12590]="700490F9\n1\tTalk to Coldan\030Talk to Legolas\tColdan can be found at the Udûn Foothold. Legolas can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth. You should talk to Coldan and Legolas.\n2\tTalk to Hithgol\tHithgol can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth. You should speak with Hithgol.\n",
[12591]="700097DE\n1\tPlace statue of Elendil on pedestal\tThere is a pedestal on the islands of Tyl Ruinen, in the middle of Lake Nenuial, where the statue of Elendil you bear once stood. Tyl Ruinen is across the lake from the island of Tinnudir. While you journeyed to meet with Gwindeth, Robin Dunkley set about remaking the broken statue you recovered from robbers in Tyrn Fornech. This is the statue that once stood upon Tyl Ruinen.\n",
[12592]="70007F23\n1\tFind Flosi's lost pick-axe\030Defeat cave-claws in cave (total: 8)\tThe cave is south-east of Thorin's Hall, in the Winterheights. Certain that he was nearing a vein of gold before being driven out of the cave, Flosi asked you to retrieve his pick-axe, as well as clear some of the cave-claws from the cave.\n2\tTalk to Flosi\030Collect Pick-axe\tFlosi is on the stairs in front of the main gate to Thorin's Hall. You should return the pick-axe to Flosi and let the old prospector know it should be safe for him to return to the cave.\n",
[12593]="70049126\n1\tPlace wards on the abandoned watch-towers (total: 3)\030Defeat tower guard spirits (total: 10)\tAbandoned watch-towers can be found along the Ered Lithui. You should place wards on the watch-towers and defeat spirits gathered there.\n2\tReturn to the watching stone\tThe watching stone is in Ered Lithui. You should return to the watching stone.\n",
[12594]="700608A8\n1\tCollect an ancient Angle artifact\tCollect an ancient artifact.\n2\tCollect ancient artifacts (total: 10)\tAncient artifacts can be found in Ost Waeren and Tham Lumren. The Elf Narnien had asked you to search for ancient artifacts.\n3\tReturn to Narnien\tNarnien is in Gaerond, in the northern Angle. You should bring the ancient artifacts to Narnien.\n",
[12595]="70034AAF\n1\tLéodwald has asked you to seek out other refugees that fled into the Balewood and help them find the cave.\t\n2\tTalk to Léodwald\tThe cave can be found to the east of the Orc roadway through the Balewood. You have found the six refugees of which Léodwald spoke. You should return to the cave and inform him of those that fell in the wilds.\n",
[12596]="7002E58B\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Oseg\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12597]="7002E555\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Oseg\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12598]="7002E578\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Hereswith\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12599]="7002E588\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12600]="7002E568\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Fréamar\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12601]="7002E584\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Hereswith\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12602]="7002E596\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12603]="7002E57D\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Edgal\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12604]="7002E57E\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Fréamar\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12605]="7004CE30\n1\tFind a clue in Nud-Melek\tYou have found a mad dwarf in Thorin's Hall that may somehow be related to the Secret Stone. He asked you to find something in Nud-melek, inside Moria.\n2\tFind someone who knows something about the flower sketch\tInside Moria, you found an old sketch of a flower. You should find someone who knows something about this flower.\n3\tFind the Nauthlandir\tThe Nauthlandir flower can possibly be found somewhere in Fangorn Forest. You should find the Nauthlandir flower.\n4\tTalk to Galathril\tGalathril resides within Lothlórien. You should talk to Galathril.\n5\tTalk to Orring\tOrring can be found in Thorin's Hall. You should bring the medicine to Orring.\n",
[12606]="7005B4BE\n1\tTalk to Rúni\tRúni is in Bazanmanar. Mother Amma has asked you to speak to Lore-master Rúni.\n2\tBring the journal to Málur Keenword\tMálur Keenword is in Bazanmanar. Lore-master Rúni has directed you to speak with Málur about the journal.\n",
[12607]="700000FB\n1\tFind the heirloom chest and return it to its tomb\tAmon Amrûn is in the eastern Fields of Fornost in the North Downs. You should search Amon Amrûn for signs of what happened to cause Colbert to go mad.\n2\tTell Colbert the Mad that the stirred shades have returned to rest\tColbert awaits you at his overlook south of Amon Amrûn. You should speak with Colbert.\n",
[12608]="700370BD\n1\tDefeat marsh-crows\tYou should drive off the draug-maddened marsh-crows from the marshes.\n2\tDefeat marsh-crows (total: 8)\tMaddened marsh-crows can be found in the marshes, east of Oserley. You should drive off the draug-maddened marsh-crows from the marshes.\n",
})
